      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Style for the negative button of the save UI to reject the save operation. This could be useful if the user needs to opt-in your service and the save prompt is an advertisement of the potential value you can add to the user. In this case, the user tapping the negative button sends a strong signal that the feature may not be useful and you may consider some backoff strategy.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/service/autofill/SaveInfo#NEGATIVE_BUTTON_STYLE_REJECT" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.service.autofill.SaveInfo.NEGATIVE_BUTTON_STYLE_REJECT</code>.</a></format></para>
